{"lyrics":"[00:03.04]Oh, oh\n[00:04.18]Oh, oh\n[00:06.72]Yeah, yeah (oh, oh, oh, oh)\n[00:08.66]Out of here, out of here\n[00:10.20]Wheezy outta here (out of here, out of here)\n[00:11.82]Ayy, Wheezy, we out of here (out of here, out of here)\n[00:14.24]Ayy, Wheezy, we out of here (out of here, out of here)\n[00:15.62]Uh, fell in love with her tongue, yeah, told bro he gotta try some\n[00:17.30]She say, \"Nigga, is you dumb? I ain't fuckin' both of y'all, only just one\"\n[00:20.60]Then she seen that money come, me countin' up Benjamin Franklins\n[00:24.08]Yeah, when she seen that, she took my brother to the room and said, \"I'll be right back\"\n[00:27.82]Little bit of rock, little bit of rap\n[00:29.68]Sold a lot of rock, I don't gotta cap\n[00:31.52]I was in the trap totin' on the glock\n[00:33.18]Whippin' on the stove, cookin' up the pot\n[00:34.66]Whole world in my hands, keep it on lock\n[00:36.64]Been through a lot shit, still shell-shocked\n[00:38.40]I got the juice, feel like 2Pac\n[00:39.86]Tryna kill me in a black Bimmer like 2Pac\n[00:42.18]I'm finna feed 'em the rounds\n[00:43.28]Finger-fuck the glizzy, I ain't fuckin' around\n[00:45.08]She fuckin' on me when her man out of town\n[00:46.86]We get up off them uppers, it go down\n[00:48.70]Smoke 'til my eyes look Ming, no Yao\n[00:50.24]I'ma ball on these niggas like ming, no Yao\n[00:52.22]How you want beef, but you a pussy?\n[00:53.94]Never seen a kitty act like a cow\n[00:55.48]Uh, fell in love with her tongue, yeah, told bro he gotta try some\n[00:58.72]She say, \"Nigga, is you dumb? I ain't fuckin' both of y'all, only just one\"\n[01:02.20]Then she seen that money come, me countin' up Benjamin Franklins\n[01:05.24]Yeah, when she seen that, she took my brother to the room and said, \"I'll be right back\" (uh)\n[01:09.54]Deep in her gut, she screamin' out facts (facts)\n[01:11.26]Screamin', \"Free Thug\", I'm screamin', \"Free Slatt\" (Slatt)\n[01:13.04]Let Melly out, I'm sorry 'bout X\n[01:14.82]I kno